674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AApUdw6T4NYQ7kNvwGxgCTy&_nc_oc=Adou-MZgRt9EOAGuPntViriWGuiYL5HIe3J1reWPvM_SGnQnGXeaJhbkw62jVepH-5I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDwY5OM8iyy_lsDwlGlfWiR2lgIp58pDZwZ1f3eRFgGyw&oe=6A6A0ED9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nGR_X9shyC0Q7kNvwH129OA&_nc_oc=Adpex_GJU-sYeKtBopmQUCxrW0bavL_syim75EBuirZSwTVELwqvMx_Wp-REUTSmWMI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDdhYi4fBRsTiCI02DIaFmjxOay6-SnVQy9V21kncmwug&oe=6A69DF56"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0rTDuYlPsKcQ7kNvwHsxGMo&_nc_oc=AdoAhCJtq2DBWrN_ywIRdFWCURdMU5pwbh3f7-B5Ix7lS0C1vY9mKGVi_K48hztSvMk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC7urUf2uh-OhzRpNahw-2HkHZROmFlf68RbbnDikEHrw&oe=6A6A13B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip